md('## Completed LangSmith annotation queues\nApproved workbook reviews were imported through the API with provenance. Eight original baseline errors and seven focused errors under reviewed labels produce 15 run reviews across 14 tickets. t046 appears in both. All 75 feedback records were read back. For t025 and t026, blank column L entries use the pre-existing AI-assisted column K explanations, with that origin recorded. Repository-only Evaluation rows were not attached to unrelated live runs.')
